# oracle: (triangles 1-3 start with nonzero angular momentum (0.01 -0.02 0.03); the point particles do not rotate) atom_style tri, read_data Atoms (triangleflag, density) and Triangles (corner points) and Velocities (omega, angmom) sections; pair_style tri/lj (triangle-triangle, triangle-point and point-point pairs, recursive discretization); fix nve/tri on the triangles and fix nve on the points; thermo, per-atom state and write_data (Triangles corners, angmom)
# oracle-inputs: w61tri_pair.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# oracle-files: w61tri_pair_in.data
units           lj
dimension       3
atom_style      tri
read_data       w61tri_pair.data
pair_style      tri/lj 4.0
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 0.3 4.0
group           tris type 1 2
group           pts id 4 5
group           tri3 id 1 2 3
neighbor        0.3 bin
timestep        0.002
fix             1 tri3 nve/tri
fix             2 pts nve
thermo_style    custom step pe ke
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
write_data      w61tri_pair_in.data
run             100
